+<dialog id="guide"><form method="dialog"><p class="eyebrow">How to play</p><h2>Controls</h2>
+<p>Move with the stick, WASD or arrows. <b>A</b> / Space jumps, up to three times in the air. <b>B</b> / Shift dashes, in the air too. <b>X</b> / J slashes and <b>Y</b> / K swings heavy; tap in rhythm to chain. <b>L</b> / Q switches walk and run. <b>R</b> / E climbs trees, rocks, lanterns and gates, and pulls the sword at the summit. <b>Start</b> / Esc opens the menu; <b>Select</b> / Tab opens the Silver Shrine.</p>
