+<tr><td>Air Slash</td><td>Air Cross, Air Backhand, Sky Cut</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Air Heavy</td><td>Air Thrust, Air Spin, Falling Cut</td></tr></table>
+<p>Stone steps rise off the path: jump up them to open a shrine cache (+10 silver). In the tunnels the light drops away and Shadow becomes a silhouette; follow the lanterns.</p>
+<p>Cut brush and trees for silver, or flush out rabbits and lizards and run them down. Silver is saved: spend it at the Silver Shrine.</p>
