+Wave Run 747 - Mara "Skim" Bennett models
+747 Mesh Lab baseline: 41,500 triangles each
+
+mara-on-ski-aqua-rush.glb   Mara riding her ski (from Aqua Rush)      - in-race model
+mara-ski-aqua-surge.glb     Ski only (from Aqua Surge Concept)        - menus / dock / empty ski
+mara-rider-tidebreaker.glb  Mara standing, A-pose (from Tidebreaker)  - menus, story scenes, rigging later
+
+All three:
+- Y-up, facing +Z (nose / face forward), origin at bottom-center
+- Real-world meters: ski 3.2 m long, Mara 1.7 m tall (same scale, so they line up)
+- Textures embedded (2048 base color, normal, metallic-roughness), glTF 2.0
+- UV seams were protected during the reduction, so the textures line up like the originals
